WEBVTT

00:11.990 --> 00:14.620
39.5 degrees Celsius.

00:14.620 --> 00:15.750
He probably just has a fever.

00:15.750 --> 00:18.120
It can't be! He looks this sick!

00:18.120 --> 00:22.270
Are you sure it's not something more life-threatening?

00:22.270 --> 00:22.830
Yes.

00:23.590 --> 00:27.840
With 99.75% certainty, he's sick due to a viral infection.

00:27.840 --> 00:29.040
Oh, how boring.

00:29.040 --> 00:32.770
"Boring"? Kyouka, please...

00:34.970 --> 00:37.050
Are you all right, Dad?

00:38.330 --> 00:40.750
I'll get better if I stay in bed for a while.

00:40.750 --> 00:42.950
Rather than that, it'll be bad if you catch it from me.

00:42.950 --> 00:45.020
Don't come too close to me.

00:45.190 --> 00:48.530
No, I'll stay close to you.

00:49.410 --> 00:50.620
Thank you.

00:50.620 --> 00:53.080
Your thoughts are enough.

02:14.060 --> 02:15.400
That's right, it's Kyouka-sama.

02:15.400 --> 02:17.260
The world's greatest peace lover.

02:17.260 --> 02:19.400
Where there's a villain, I'll punish 'em.
Where there's a good guy, I give 'em a spanking!

02:19.720 --> 02:21.370
Time for another frenzy party!

02:46.380 --> 02:48.320
We must divide the work.

02:48.320 --> 02:49.230
Divide the work?

02:52.940 --> 02:57.070
While Ouka's sick in bed, we have turned to chaos.

02:57.070 --> 03:01.070
We'll take care of the household chores in place of Ouka!

03:01.070 --> 03:03.770
So you say, but can you do any chores?

03:03.770 --> 03:07.840
I remember Father having a near-death experience because of the food you cooked.

03:09.800 --> 03:11.440
I'll now announce the assignments!

03:11.440 --> 03:13.380
Hold on! What was that moment of pause about?

03:13.380 --> 03:17.880
Rest assured. As a most wonderful fact,
I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

03:22.280 --> 03:23.840
Is everyone here?

03:23.840 --> 03:25.260
One moment!

03:25.260 --> 03:25.970
What?

03:26.380 --> 03:28.770
Why am I different from everyone else?

03:28.770 --> 03:30.810
An overall apron!

03:31.720 --> 03:34.510
I chose an outfit that fits best for each person.

03:34.510 --> 03:37.270
It looks good on your overly-developed body.

03:41.990 --> 03:45.800
Okay, from now on, I shall call you proprietress.

03:45.800 --> 03:46.970
Proprietress?!

03:49.480 --> 03:51.290
I'll now announce the work.

03:51.870 --> 03:53.610
Hyouka, go wash the bath.

03:53.610 --> 03:54.800
Chika, go do laundry.

03:55.210 --> 03:58.250
Yuuka and Teika, go shopping for dinner.

03:58.920 --> 04:01.880
Ginka, you make porridge or something for Ouka.

04:02.310 --> 04:04.130
Gekka, you...

04:06.930 --> 04:08.920
...wiggle in the air.

04:11.140 --> 04:13.490
What will you be doing, Mother?

04:14.290 --> 04:15.770
I will of course...

04:16.100 --> 04:19.150
...nurse my beloved hubby.

04:19.980 --> 04:21.280
Sorry to make you wait, Ouka!

04:22.170 --> 04:24.910
I shall nurse you myself!

04:28.110 --> 04:30.200
Is he asleep?

04:42.500 --> 04:43.860
So cold.

04:50.480 --> 04:51.470
I'm bored.

04:51.470 --> 04:55.310
Just waiting is against my philosophy!

04:57.830 --> 04:59.310
Rejoice, Ouka!

04:59.310 --> 05:03.940
The one and absolute god, and at the same time, helper of the sick hubby, Kyouka-sama, has come to a great idea.

05:03.940 --> 05:10.490
Book: Kill!
Home Health Encyclopedia

05:04.230 --> 05:07.700
Increase the metabolism
and increase the self-repair function.

05:07.700 --> 05:10.500
To do that, the best method is to sweat!

05:11.780 --> 05:13.830
Well, we're simply off.

05:13.830 --> 05:15.000
Keep your eyes on her.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.520
Leave it to me.

05:16.520 --> 05:20.710
I will protect Honored Sister even if it costs my life.

05:21.980 --> 05:23.920
Off you go.

05:23.920 --> 05:27.590
I'd better get to my work.

05:27.590 --> 05:28.920
Oh, yeah.

05:30.650 --> 05:33.670
Kitty, I've come to collect the laundry.

05:39.460 --> 05:42.190
Ouka-san!!!

05:47.290 --> 05:49.270
I feel alive again!

05:49.270 --> 05:51.040
We don't care about you.

05:51.040 --> 05:53.080
You almost killed Ouka-san.

05:53.080 --> 05:55.760
You'll prematurely age if you yell too much, proprietress.

05:55.760 --> 05:57.480
Stop calling me a proprietress.

05:57.480 --> 06:00.330
Anyway, don't do anything strange.

06:00.330 --> 06:04.400
Illnesses go away if you take enough nutrition and stay in bed.

06:06.670 --> 06:07.590
Nutrition!

06:08.590 --> 06:11.260
Chika's pretty smart.

06:11.630 --> 06:14.770
For sick people, vitamin C is essential.

06:14.770 --> 06:16.940
I don't have any basis for that statement, but I think it does.

06:21.890 --> 06:25.030
All that squeezing and I only got this much?

06:25.150 --> 06:26.940
This is too much of a pain! I can't keep doing this!

06:29.730 --> 06:32.160
It got in my eyes!

06:33.780 --> 06:36.320
What a dangerous fruit.

06:36.320 --> 06:38.400
It's yellow, and it's even shaped strangely.

06:52.180 --> 06:54.550
Frozen hard.

06:54.930 --> 06:55.940
Out of my way.

06:58.930 --> 07:01.030
This is nursing.

07:02.940 --> 07:04.230
What are you doing?

07:05.360 --> 07:09.180
N-No! You got it wrong!
I wasn't trying to sneak into his bed!

07:09.180 --> 07:11.610
Ginka-san, you pervert!

07:11.610 --> 07:12.780
What is she doing?

07:19.650 --> 07:21.040
Maybe I'll have a little bit of fun.

07:21.500 --> 07:23.540
What might you be doing?

07:24.940 --> 07:27.750
Doing something so unmanly again...

07:30.330 --> 07:32.950
I guess you deserve a little punishment.

07:43.080 --> 07:43.990
Oops.

07:49.110 --> 07:53.170
Ginichi-san, why don't you understand?

07:53.170 --> 07:58.200
I'm conveying to you my feelings so clearly and strongly.

08:13.010 --> 08:14.400
Gekka!

08:14.400 --> 08:17.740
I was wondering where you were,
and you were wiggling in a place like that?!

08:17.740 --> 08:19.690
You pervert jellyfish!

08:19.690 --> 08:21.890
Where exactly were you wiggling at? There?

08:20.760 --> 08:22.090
Oh yeah.

08:22.430 --> 08:23.730
How's this?!

08:23.730 --> 08:25.100
How about this?

08:25.100 --> 08:26.310
You should!

08:26.310 --> 08:27.360
Be in!

08:27.360 --> 08:28.440
More pain!

08:28.610 --> 08:31.610
Don't try to outdo Kyouka-sama.

08:32.870 --> 08:34.000
Bring it.

08:34.000 --> 08:35.360
Why you...

08:36.280 --> 08:37.820
Take this!

08:38.980 --> 08:40.830
It might work if I weld it back on.

08:56.590 --> 08:59.470
You're all simply failures!

08:59.470 --> 09:01.040
Especially you, Mom.

09:01.550 --> 09:03.600
You have to simply reflect on your actions.

09:04.850 --> 09:06.180
I'm sorry.

09:09.060 --> 09:11.610
Yuuka-chan was seriously angry.

09:11.610 --> 09:13.380
No one can blame her.

09:17.610 --> 09:19.160
I'm sorry, everyone.

09:19.720 --> 09:22.370
You're not the only one worthy of blame.

09:22.370 --> 09:23.620
I've made up my mind.

09:23.620 --> 09:26.020
Even a dog can just wait.

09:26.020 --> 09:28.190
Then what will I, as a god, do?

09:28.190 --> 09:29.420
Kitty!

09:29.420 --> 09:32.130
Fight, of course.

09:34.340 --> 09:36.460
Where are we?

09:36.460 --> 09:37.130
Some ruins.

09:37.540 --> 09:39.100
I'll change the question.

09:39.100 --> 09:41.560
Why are we at ruins?

09:41.560 --> 09:44.380
Aren't we trying to cure Father's illness?

09:44.380 --> 09:45.980
Great question.

09:45.980 --> 09:52.390
In these ruins there's supposedly some nice item that gives infinite power or whatnot to anyone who holds it.

09:52.390 --> 09:55.440
You're thinking of curing Father's illness with that?

09:55.440 --> 09:58.100
Not only will he be cured,

09:58.100 --> 10:00.450
but I bet he'll power up three-fold compared to before!

10:03.790 --> 10:05.170
Here it is!

10:05.170 --> 10:08.060
I was walking randomly,
and I actually found what we were looking for!

10:08.060 --> 10:10.410
It's nothing but god's will.

10:11.820 --> 10:13.130
Crap, it's a trap.

10:13.130 --> 10:15.550
Hey, what are we going to do, Kitty?!

10:15.550 --> 10:18.050
I thought things would take care of themselves, but...

10:18.050 --> 10:19.550
No, they won't!

10:19.550 --> 10:23.180
We should hurry and leave rather than talk.

10:28.070 --> 10:29.920
Your great mother's home!

10:29.920 --> 10:31.560
I thought I was going to die.

10:31.560 --> 10:34.100
Where did all of you simply go to?

10:34.100 --> 10:35.710
Ouka comes first!

10:38.750 --> 10:41.320
How do we even use that?

10:41.320 --> 10:43.470
It looks like we just put it on his face?

10:43.470 --> 10:45.640
We'll find out once we try.

10:57.180 --> 10:59.100
Look, he's so full of energy.

10:59.100 --> 11:01.070
Something's obviously wrong!

11:01.070 --> 11:02.840
Now that you mention it...

11:02.840 --> 11:05.680
He is a little too energetic.

11:06.500 --> 11:09.860
Dad's simply become weird!

11:09.860 --> 11:11.030
I guess I don't have a choice.

11:16.610 --> 11:21.610
Therefore, Kyouka-sama has been yelled at by Yuuka.

11:21.610 --> 11:23.830
I think you had it coming.

11:23.830 --> 11:26.640
He's been diagnosed as being
two weeks from a full recovery.

11:27.870 --> 11:31.870
However! Kyouka-sama doesn't give up with this!

11:31.870 --> 11:33.880
Let's go everyone!

11:33.880 --> 11:35.770
Where to this time?

11:35.770 --> 11:37.460
We don't have a choice.

11:50.350 --> 11:54.250
Mother! Why are we at a place like this?!

11:54.250 --> 11:55.520
Great question!

11:55.700 --> 12:01.900
Apparently a plant called Mandragora that grows around here is very nutritious!

12:03.750 --> 12:04.940
Ginichi-san!

12:04.940 --> 12:08.010
Chika-chan... I can't go on...

12:08.010 --> 12:10.230
You mustn't sleep, Ginichi-san!

12:10.230 --> 12:11.650
You'll die if you fall asleep.

12:10.970 --> 12:12.910
You're killing me...

12:11.650 --> 12:12.910
Wake up, Ginichi-san!

12:13.890 --> 12:15.770
Now that's my children.

12:15.770 --> 12:18.390
How very lively even in this snowstorm.

12:18.390 --> 12:19.750
Mother.

12:19.750 --> 12:21.280
What is it, Hyouka?

12:21.280 --> 12:22.050
That.

12:31.470 --> 12:34.270
That's it! It's Mandragora!

12:34.270 --> 12:35.310
I'll go get it then.

12:35.310 --> 12:42.100
Hold on. According to this book, there is a special way of extracting it discovered in ancient times.

12:42.100 --> 12:43.530
Come, Teika.

12:46.320 --> 12:48.320
Everyone, put your headphones on.

12:49.930 --> 12:55.500
Grim reaper? Quit it. Really, quit it.

12:53.120 --> 12:55.050
Wh-What is this?

12:55.500 --> 12:58.000
D-Don't come near me.

12:55.500 --> 12:58.000
Good. Teika, go!

12:58.000 --> 12:58.700
Roar!

13:04.980 --> 13:08.680
Mandragora makes a spine-chilling scream when it's extracted.

13:09.140 --> 13:14.930
If you hear it directly, the shock will kill you, so it's always been a dog that pulls it out.

13:14.930 --> 13:17.940
That was mean...

13:23.750 --> 13:24.970
It's ready!

13:24.970 --> 13:27.240
Will Dad get better with that?

13:27.240 --> 13:29.590
Those who believe in Kyouka-sama will be saved.

13:29.590 --> 13:31.160
That's the proof that I'm a god!

13:31.160 --> 13:34.010
Gulp this down.

13:36.520 --> 13:38.460
He's in no condition to drink.

13:38.460 --> 13:41.750
Then how about you making him drink with mouth-to-mouth?

13:43.760 --> 13:45.940
I-I can't do that!

13:45.940 --> 13:47.720
Then maybe I'll do it.

13:47.920 --> 13:49.890
I won't let you!

13:51.490 --> 13:53.250
Me?

13:54.770 --> 13:56.080
Nee-sama!

13:56.080 --> 13:57.770
I can't.

13:59.270 --> 14:00.640
Hyouka-chan!

14:01.100 --> 14:02.070
Me?

14:03.570 --> 14:05.400
Give that to me!

14:13.140 --> 14:15.840
It all went to waste.

14:15.840 --> 14:18.320
What were we doing?

14:18.320 --> 14:20.070
D-Dad?!

14:21.510 --> 14:24.380
Dad! Hang in there, Dad!

14:27.040 --> 14:28.030
Look.

14:28.590 --> 14:30.620
What's this dark spot?

14:30.620 --> 14:33.680
This looks like the cause of Ouka's illness.

14:33.680 --> 14:35.530
Yesterday, you said it was just a plain virus infection.

14:35.530 --> 14:38.010
When I checked, it really was just a virus infection.

14:38.010 --> 14:41.650
So something happened to him after that.

14:41.650 --> 14:46.360
Who cares about the past! What we need to discuss is what we need to do to save Ouka!

14:46.360 --> 14:50.000
But isn't surgery up here really difficult?

14:50.000 --> 14:51.970
I already have a countermeasure ready.

14:53.710 --> 14:55.720
Wh-When did all these...

14:55.720 --> 14:57.570
If we can't take care of things from the outside, then we will from the inside!

14:57.570 --> 15:00.200
We'll enter his body and take care of the problem directly!

15:02.700 --> 15:07.470
We'll change ourselves into a micro-size and enter Ouka's body!

15:08.670 --> 15:11.380
Mother, isn't there a more normal way?

15:11.380 --> 15:12.790
Stop whining!

15:12.790 --> 15:15.710
We'll go in, cure, and come out!

15:19.570 --> 15:21.700
Noooooo~~~

15:26.410 --> 15:28.360
Yuuka, we leave Ouka in your care.

15:28.360 --> 15:31.080
Y-Yes. Best of luck to you, too, Mom.

15:31.080 --> 15:33.510
We'll now begin today's party.

15:53.540 --> 15:56.590
So this is what Ouka's insides are like. Pretty interesting.

15:56.590 --> 15:58.800
Are you sure we can relax like this?

15:59.300 --> 16:00.840
Ah, right.

16:00.840 --> 16:03.020
Full speed ahead to the affected zone!

16:03.920 --> 16:04.850
What's this about?

16:04.850 --> 16:07.030
We're under attack by white blood cells.

16:07.030 --> 16:08.800
White blood cells? What are those?

16:08.800 --> 16:11.610
They're cells that wipe out foreign pathogens that enter the body.

16:12.020 --> 16:13.930
Hey, are you sure we're fine?

16:13.930 --> 16:15.740
Don't worry; I'll shake them off soon enough.

16:25.460 --> 16:28.630
Forgot to mention it, but make sure you fasten your seat belts.

16:28.630 --> 16:31.370
Please say things like that earlier.

16:31.370 --> 16:33.030
You're heavy.

16:33.030 --> 16:34.130
So rude!

16:37.360 --> 16:40.120
Is Mom doing all right?

16:44.710 --> 16:46.230
What is it this time?

16:46.230 --> 16:49.730
The blood flow is rapid since we're close to the heart.

16:49.730 --> 16:51.420
Give me a break.

16:52.920 --> 16:54.360
It's getting fun.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.490
It's not fun at all!

16:59.470 --> 17:00.950
What is that?

17:00.950 --> 17:02.290
It's a heart valve.

17:02.290 --> 17:04.550
Won't we crash if we keep going?

17:04.550 --> 17:05.990
Yeah, we will.

17:05.990 --> 17:08.070
Kitty, stop!

17:08.070 --> 17:10.050
No worries! We'll go right in!

17:10.920 --> 17:12.630
I have already taken precautions.

17:14.740 --> 17:15.590
Do it!

17:20.680 --> 17:22.100
Dad!

17:22.920 --> 17:23.850
Now!

17:23.850 --> 17:25.520
What did you do, Mother?

17:25.520 --> 17:27.870
I stopped the heart for just a bit.

17:27.870 --> 17:29.380
Stopped...

17:29.380 --> 17:31.110
...the heart?

17:31.110 --> 17:33.380
You'll kill him if you do that!

17:33.380 --> 17:36.620
Don't worry; he's just in asphyxia for a few seconds.

17:36.620 --> 17:38.660
That's not the issue here...

17:39.230 --> 17:44.050
Besides, a god's husband can't be so weak as to die from a stopped heart.

17:44.050 --> 17:48.540
If it does stop, then start moving it with your will!

18:06.040 --> 18:07.270
There's nothing?

18:07.270 --> 18:08.380
How strange.

18:08.380 --> 18:10.640
Hyouka, are we really at the right place?

18:10.640 --> 18:13.320
I'm sure. That black shadow was right here.

18:16.760 --> 18:17.810
Mother!

18:17.810 --> 18:18.960
What is this?

18:18.960 --> 18:21.530
Could this be the cause of the black shadow?

18:26.460 --> 18:28.620
That's the mask we found at the ruin.

18:28.620 --> 18:29.500
What?

18:29.500 --> 18:32.290
It's become a lot smaller, but that is the main body.

18:32.370 --> 18:35.960
I'm just guessing, but it might be
a nanomachine from ancient times.

18:38.550 --> 18:42.600
It doesn't matter what it is.
We'll eradicate the cause as we planned!

18:45.190 --> 18:46.880
It's not working very well!

18:46.880 --> 18:48.620
Just keep on shooting!

18:50.000 --> 18:51.220
It won't work?

18:54.400 --> 18:55.890
Retreat!

19:05.950 --> 19:09.960
Damn you. I don't care if you're an ancient nanomachine.

19:09.960 --> 19:13.080
You're just leftover waste, and you dare stand up against this perfect Kyouka-sama?

19:13.420 --> 19:14.630
Take this!

19:17.460 --> 19:18.610
Dad?!

19:18.610 --> 19:20.220
Hang in there, Dad!

19:22.220 --> 19:23.640
It's catching up!

19:23.640 --> 19:24.610
Leave it to me!

19:31.770 --> 19:34.070
You're so great, Ginichi-san.

19:35.070 --> 19:36.650
We can't lose to them.

19:36.650 --> 19:37.760
Take 'em on, Hyouka!

19:37.760 --> 19:38.430
Okay.

19:40.740 --> 19:42.840
Hyouka Cutter!

19:47.080 --> 19:48.160
This is the end!

19:54.140 --> 19:55.710
D-Dad?

19:57.980 --> 19:59.410
Kyouka-sama wins!

20:05.670 --> 20:08.280
Dad's back to normal.

20:11.250 --> 20:13.780
Oh no, we only have six minutes left.

20:13.780 --> 20:14.770
Six minutes?

20:14.770 --> 20:18.610
We can only maintain this micro size for an hour.

20:18.610 --> 20:21.280
And we're at fifty-four minutes right now.

20:21.280 --> 20:23.740
What will happen if the time limit comes?

20:23.740 --> 20:25.590
We'll go back to our original size.

20:25.590 --> 20:27.090
Back to our original size?

20:28.730 --> 20:30.710
Say things like that earlier!

20:30.710 --> 20:32.560
I totally forgot about it.

20:34.970 --> 20:36.720
Wh-What do we do?

20:36.720 --> 20:37.790
What should I do?

20:38.700 --> 20:41.300
Eyes! Eyes are the closest hole to the brain.

20:41.300 --> 20:43.710
But how do we get out of an eye?

20:44.280 --> 20:45.300
I know!

20:45.300 --> 20:47.360
Yuuka! Do you hear me, Yuuka?!

20:47.360 --> 20:48.420
Mom?!

20:48.420 --> 20:51.140
Pour lemon juice into Ouka's eyes!

20:51.140 --> 20:52.500
L-Lemon?

20:52.500 --> 20:54.170
We're short on time! Do as I say!

20:54.170 --> 20:57.420
It's too sudden, and I simply don't know what to do.

20:57.420 --> 20:58.640
Go to the kitchen!

21:00.710 --> 21:01.530
These?

21:04.030 --> 21:06.500
Dad, I'm sorry.

21:09.820 --> 21:13.050
Wh-Why did you do such a thing, Yuuka?!

21:15.270 --> 21:16.850
We made it in time.

21:16.850 --> 21:17.970
Mom!

21:17.970 --> 21:20.350
Thank goodness. You simply made it in time.

21:20.350 --> 21:22.580
Yes. Now Ouka should be-

21:22.580 --> 21:24.840
Hey, where is Ouka?

21:24.840 --> 21:27.050
He was here until a moment ago.

21:30.080 --> 21:32.430
Ouka!

21:41.060 --> 21:42.820
Sorry to make you wait, Ouka!

21:42.820 --> 21:43.840
Kyouka?!

21:43.840 --> 21:46.800
You must have been lonely to be away from your beloved wife.

21:46.800 --> 21:48.400
But rest assured!

21:48.400 --> 21:51.570
From this moment on, Kyouka-sama will take care of you day and night.

21:51.570 --> 21:54.700
No, see, I have to stay still.

21:55.730 --> 21:59.710
Don't hesitate. I will nurse you properly this time.

22:21.180 --> 22:24.890
If you're a noble pig, then die after you accomplish your mission.

22:24.890 --> 22:27.390
You're only a noble if you can consistently push yourself past your limit.

22:27.390 --> 22:30.150
Don't resist! Surpass yourself!

23:40.160 --> 23:41.940
Woho! Wo wo ho!

23:41.940 --> 23:46.250
Onsen! Onsen! Onsen with everyone!
Fun onsen! We're at Kumagoroshi! Yay!

23:46.250 --> 23:48.480
Yuuka, there's a strange creature.

23:48.480 --> 23:51.950
Next time: Even If You Don't Want To Be,
You're the Klutz Devil.

23:51.950 --> 23:53.210
Yo, yo.

23:53.210 --> 23:54.210
Yo, yo.
